# Alert 2 – /var Filesystem Utilization

## Alert

```text
Disk /var Warning

Used : 83%
Threshold : 80%
```

---

## Investigation

Verified filesystem usage.

```bash
df -h
```

Identified directories consuming space.

```bash
cd /var
du -sh *
du -sh /var/log/*
```

Located large files.

```bash
find /var/log -type f -size +500M
```

---

## Root Cause

Old application logs and archived log files consumed most of the filesystem.
---

## Resolution
Compressed active log files.

```bash
gzip filename.log
```

Removed obsolete compressed logs based on the retention policy.

Verified free space.

```bash
df -h
```

---

## Skills Demonstrated

* Linux Filesystem Management
* Log Management
* Capacity Planning

